// PHASE 1 v4 — Grid-based collision (full redesign)
// Movement now uses a TILE GRID: each tile is either walkable
// (room floor or corridor) or a wall. This is how real 2D games
// handle collision — predictable, no margin/overlap bugs.
// Corridors are wide "galiyan" connecting rooms, with doors marking
// each room<->corridor connection. Placeholder colors; IronClaw theme later.
// ============================================================

